{"id": "2312512", "name": "מד״ר פרידה – שורש ופתרון קבוע", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q8_SEPARABLE_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">משוואה ניתנת להפרדת משתנים</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.9;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 8px; color: #665f6b; font-size: 14px;\">עבדו בתחום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle -{{CT:1}}.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">א. פתרונות קבועים</div>\n<div>מצאו את קבוצת הערכים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle A\\)</span> שעבורם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle y(x)=a\\)</span> הוא פתרון קבוע.</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;\">\\(\\displaystyle A=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 6px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">ב. בעיית התחלה</div>\n<div>מצאו את הפתרון המקיים</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle y({{CT:2}})={{CT:3}}\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle y(x)=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 6px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q8_SEPARABLE_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<p><strong>א.</strong> לפני שמחלקים ב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle y+{{CT:4}}\\)</span> בודקים מתי גורם זה מתאפס. מתקבל הפתרון הקבוע</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle y=-{{CT:4}}\\)</div>\n<p>ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle A={{CT:5}}\\)</span>.</p>\n<p><strong>ב.</strong> עבור פתרון שאינו קבוע מפרידים משתנים</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\frac{dy}{y+{{CT:4}}}={{CT:6}}\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{{{CT:1}}^2-x^2}}\\,dx\\)</div>\n<p>לאחר אינטגרציה מתקבל</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\ln|y+{{CT:4}}|=-{{CT:6}}\\sqrt{{{CT:1}}^2-x^2}+C\\)</div>\n<p>כלומר</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle y+{{CT:4}}=C e^{-{{CT:6}}\\sqrt{{{CT:1}}^2-x^2}}\\)</div>\n<p>מציבים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x=0\\)</span> ואת תנאי ההתחלה, ומקבלים</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold;\">\\(\\displaystyle y(x)={{CT:7}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">\n<div>[[feedback:Result]]</div>\n<div>[[feedback:Result2]]</div>\n</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 18, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "למשל: {-3}", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 38, "insertstars": 5, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "ביטוי ב-x", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "sing", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "Result2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "particular", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["b", "k", "ode", "particular", "s", "sing", "x0", "y0"], "nvariants": 50}